    <item>
      <title>Core Concept</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/features/shadow/concept/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/features/shadow/concept/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;production-database&#34;&gt;Production Database&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;production-database&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#production-database&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Database for production data&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;shadow-database&#34;&gt;Shadow Database&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;shadow-database&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#shadow-database&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Database for stress test data isolation. Configurations should be the same as the Production Database.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;Shadow Algorithm&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#shadow-algorithm&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shadow Algorithm, which is closely related to business operations, currently has 2 types.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Column based shadow algorithm
Routing to shadow database by recognizing data from SQL. Suitable for stress test scenario that has an emphasis on data list.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hint based shadow algorithm
Routing to shadow database by recognizing comments from SQL. Suitable for stress test driven by the identification of upstream system passage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Limitations</title>
      <link>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/features/shadow/limitations/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/features/shadow/limitations/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
        
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;hint-based-shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;Hint based shadow algorithm&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;hint-based-shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#hint-based-shadow-algorithm&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;No&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id=&#34;column-based-shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;Column based shadow algorithm&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;column-based-shadow-algorithm&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#column-based-shadow-algorithm&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;SQL does not support lists：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does not support DDL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does not support scope, group, subqueries such as BETWEEN, GROUP BY &amp;hellip; HAVING, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SQL support list&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;INSERT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;em&gt;SQL&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;em&gt;support or not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;INSERT INTO table (column,&amp;hellip;) VALUES (value,&amp;hellip;)&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;INSERT INTO table (column,&amp;hellip;) VALUES (value,&amp;hellip;),(value,&amp;hellip;),&amp;hellip;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;INSERT INTO table (column,&amp;hellip;) SELECT column1 from table1 where column1 = value1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;do not support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;em&gt;condition categories&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;em&gt;SQL&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;&lt;em&gt;support or not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;=&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE column = value&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;LIKE/NOT LIKE&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE column LIKE/NOT LIKE value&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;IN/NOT IN&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE column IN/NOT IN (value1,value2,&amp;hellip;)&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;BETWEEN&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE column BETWEEN value1 AND value2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;do not support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;GROUP BY &amp;hellip; HAVING&amp;hellip;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE &amp;hellip; GROUP BY column HAVING column &amp;gt; value&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;do not support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Sub Query&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;SELECT/UPDATE/DELETE &amp;hellip; WHERE column = (SELECT column FROM table WHERE column = value)&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;do not support&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

      </description>
    </item>
    
